<title>UK: General Accident down after Capel comment.</title>
<headline>General Accident down after Capel comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Accident Plc led insurance stocks lower on Wednesday after analysts at brokerages including HSBC James Capel advised taking profits in the stock, market sources said.</p>
<p>General Accident shares were down 21p at 978 by 0940 GMT.</p>
